     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Sorry, I know you&#39;ve probably had this question before. I have performed a search in this forum but i&#39;m not quite sure if this question has been asked, it&#39;s more likely that I&#39;m not understanding properly.</div><div><br></div><div>The isolate function basically withholds executing the logic if the action button is 0? Is that correct?. The code below is some one elses example I found while searching for a solution.</div><div>So this line of logic &quot;<font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;white-space:pre-wrap\">finalFib&lt;- reactive({ </font><font color=\"#0000ff\" style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;white-space:pre-wrap\">1</font><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;white-space:pre-wrap\"> / currentFib })&quot; is executed once the action button is pressed, right?</font></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.14902);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;border-radius:4px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><code style=\"font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">function</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:inherit\">,</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">output</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\">\r\n  </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">currentFib</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">reactive</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fib</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">as.numeric</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><font color=\"#687687\">)\r\n</font></code><code style=\"font-size:12.025px;font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\">  isolate({\r\n  if(actionButton==0)\r\n  return()</font><font color=\"#687687\">\r\n</font>  </code><code style=\"font-size:12.025px;font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\">finalFib&lt;- reactive({ </font><font color=\"#0000ff\">1</font><font color=\"#000000\"> / currentFib })\r\n  })</font></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>In my bit of code I have a number of numeric inputs that are used in an algorithm that is executed via an action button.</div><div><br></div><div>so my code is</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$goButtonCustom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>     input$goButtonCustom<br><br>     output$textbox </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Some text&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>     variableInput </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$variableNumericInput<br><br>     calcFunction</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">variableInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#end observe Event</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></font></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>My code works as expected and waits until the user presses the go button before it performs the calculation (I have more inputs than above, I was just showing one for simplicity)</div><div><br></div><div>My app prints the contents of the input boxes at the same time as the result from calcFunction prints it&#39;s results as per the example below.</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,Calibri,Candara,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Number of cases: 100000</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Number of controls: 150000</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">P-value threshold: 5</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Odds ratio: 1.5</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"></div></div><h3 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:helvetica;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.5;color:rgb(7,7,7);font-size:12pt;background-color:rgb(214,212,212);border-radius:4px\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Power estimate: &gt;30%</div></h3><br></div><div>Once the button has been pressed if the user updates the numbers in the numeric Inputs the numbers for each of the inputs i.e. cases/controls/p-value are updated automatically but the calcFunction is not.</div><div><br></div><div>How would I be able to only update the output text boxes for cases/controls/p-value etc only when the action button is pressed?</div><div><br></div><div>Does that make sense? Am I doing the wrong thing by placing the logic inside an observeEvent as opposed to observe?</div><div>would some code like this help? Which I&#39;ve tried but doesn&#39;t seem to work.</div><div><br></div><div>Do I have to wrap each renderText in a separate isolate() or can I use one for the whole lot? Will this train of thought prevent the output texts being updated automatically or am I going in the wrong direction?</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#000\">observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$goButtonCustom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$goButtonCustom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>      isolate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          </span></font><span style=\"color:#000\">     output$textbox </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Some text&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               variableInput </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$variableNumericInput<br><br>               calcFunction</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">variableInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></font><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#000\">             </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#end observe event</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span></font></div></code></div><br>Thanks for your help,</div><div>Bobbie.</div></div>"
