ot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\">  isolate({\r\n  if(actionButton==0)\r\n  return()</font><font color=\"#687687\">\r\n</font>  </code><code style=\"font-size:12.025px;font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\">finalFib&lt;- reactive({ </font><font color=\"#0000ff\">1</font><font color=\"#000000\"> / currentFib })\r\n  })</font></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>In my bit of code I have a number of numeric inputs that are used in an algorithm that is executed via an action button.</div><div><br></div><div>so my code is</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$goButtonCustom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>     input$goButtonCustom<br><br>     output$textbox </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Some text&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>     variableInput </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$variableNumericInput<br><br>     calcFunction</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">variableInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span sty